oe=69CFC1DE"}, {"file_name": "115.png", "id": "1452980166228862", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620875_1452980172895528_3408575233146654177_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N7x-s4HC1RIQ7kNvwF-6PWd&_nc_oc=AdquK8yZQmKgqKjqUaADatLkOcH9rURKdmOHsR07ZfPdSUWVfjzKIt0HcgsH8ZMH_CA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyZyVwuLN0p-tlWj5hTuIPV7Yv3w7XCe0XhsnOryoasNA&oe=69CFC912"}, {"file_name": "112.png", "id": "919234247326315", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298291_919234250659648_3225944418494968782_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vA5a3ZkRQM0Q7kNvwHJLsQv&_nc_oc=Adpz171lJ_e5bBI95OwaKTMbbRdoRfnY59yUBjOgkJpGBG41IM_EmwccyeuR_HlqJo8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afy2h7ymSyYFfhXLcsdcLA06Idp7cuEVS9jbyzRfOOr0uQ&oe=69CFA3C8"}, {"file_name": "113.png", "id": "932200949318965", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296183_932200952652298_7166229103004231922_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JmYDIqK0S38Q7kNvwG83_Kg&_nc_oc=Adoo60xSc-UaE81R9J7_PpcOWFDTki_0YnnukGsqxrj9IvIg58PTI1yHlUxhED2PepY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzZMXWpz1_LVOMx3LZofqroBjIUyqYFNMF7twhEKKBDTw&oe=69CFBB96"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_2560.png", "id": "985057036727083", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036639_985057043393749_3945160790566893943_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fCzjNfjiTfgQ7kNvwE8winM&_nc_oc=Adq7SU0TG52FhRGGYDE4DdDD9gNusKks9lz4vQkAK8SD28dmIOaCA-VbuNvR9Qh9UB0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afxu34oNxIFHYDy0apyJF14CL1lSyCmWG0qvYIEQe_NBsw&oe=69CFAD0F"}, "display_name": "Peak Rhythm", "keywords": ["Peak", "Rhythm", "Climbing", "Beat"], "long_description": "**Peak Rhythm** is a VR rhythm-climbing game where music drives momentum. Every grab and twist powers your robotic platform upward through a neon-soaked city.\n\nSync your moves to a high-octane electronic soundtrack to master the flow and dominate global leaderboards. Blending physical precision with Cyberpunk aesthetics and Y2K energy, your rhythm is your engine.\n\n**Don\u2019t just climb\u2014perform.**\n\n{3227020670835876}\n\n### \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f GAME FEATURES\n\n- **Rhythm-Powered Climbing:** Master \u201cRegular\u201d grabs, \u201cMulti-Twists\u201d (volume knob motion), and \u201cDouble\u201d holds on a 5x5 grid. Perfect hits boost your speed; misses slow you down.\n- **Solo Mastery:** Ascend 8 original tracks across 3 difficulties to perfect your runs. Compete for the highest altitude on map-specific leaderboards.\n- **The Soundtrack:** Launching with music from indie artists **FEISTLING, Killin\u2019 Void, Ion Diary,** and **funiel**, spanning Drum & Bass, Dubstep, and House.\n- **Custom Content:** Includes a fully functional **Beatmap Editor** at launch. Create your own maps with your own music.\n\n{1918357589050667}\n\n### \ud83d\ude80 EARLY ACCESS ROADMAP\n\nThe climb is just beginning. We are committed to delivering frequent updates based on your feedback. Planned features include:\n\n- **Social Multiplayer:** Climb side-by-side with friends in real-time.\n- **Ranked Mode:** Competitive knockout tournaments.\n- **Voice Chat:** In-game communication.\n- **Character Customization:** Personalize your avatar\u2019s look.\n- **Cross-Platform Play:** Expanding to other VR headsets.\n\nJoin our community to help shape the future of Peak Rhythm!\n\n\n**[Discord Link: https://discord.gg/RZuzxpRcyV]**", "short_description": "Ascend to the beat in Peak Rhythm! In this VR rhythm-climbing game, every grab and twist drives your robotic platform upward through a neon-soaked city. Sync your moves to a high-octane electronic soundtrack to master the flow and dominate global leaderboards. Blending physical precision with Cyberpunk aesthetics, your rhythm is yo